# SoundPlant demo: house_909, 126 BPM, Bb major. Factory sounds only: tools/make_demos.py puts it on the emulator page.
# Piano house in Bb, 104 bars. A syncopated two-bar piano riff over Bbmaj7 | Gm7 | Ebmaj7 | F6 is the hook; a soprano chop
# answers it in the gaps, the bass bounces under it, the 909 kit drives it. After the first drop the piano drops out and the
# bass and the chop trade the hook (8 bars), then the piano plays the riff's melody alone over new chords (Cm9 F13 Bbmaj9
# Ebmaj9 | Am7b5 D7 Gm), the kit and a snare roll bring the riff back, and drop 2 is lifted a whole tone to C.
# T1 909 kit  T2 knit finger bass  T3 sample piano (the riff's chords, the break's left hand)  T4 sample piano (the riff's tune)
# T5 voile soprano chop  T6 knit ribbon pad  T7 rayon glass bell  T8 a second kit: shaker, conga, toms, rim
# Song: intro 8 (the riff alone, the kick at bar 5), groove 8, pre 4, drop 16, switch 8, break 8, build 8, drop 2 24 (+2),
# outro 8, coda 8 (piano and chop), the riff once more alone (4).
bpm 126
knob 9 e1 0
knob 9 e2 10
knob 9 e3 0

# ---- the sounds
# T1 the 909 kit: kick, clap, closed and open hat, snare for the rolls, toms
knob 1 d1.model 21
knob 1 d1.k1 45
knob 1 d1.k2 70
knob 1 d1.k3 30
knob 1 d1.k4 34
knob 1 d1.k5 0
knob 1 d1.k6 20
knob 1 d1.k7 0
knob 1 d1.volume 94
knob 1 d2.model 22
knob 1 d2.volume 74
knob 1 d2.send2 36
knob 1 d5.model 25
knob 1 d5.k1 63
knob 1 d5.k2 50
knob 1 d5.k3 30
knob 1 d5.k4 0
knob 1 d5.volume 74
knob 1 d5.send2 30
knob 1 d4.model 27
knob 1 d4.k1 64
knob 1 d4.k2 70
knob 1 d4.k3 0
knob 1 d4.k4 0
knob 1 d4.volume 66
knob 1 d3.model 26
knob 1 d3.k1 64
knob 1 d3.k2 84
knob 1 d3.k3 0
knob 1 d3.k4 0
knob 1 d3.volume 58
knob 1 d6.model 23
knob 1 d6.k4 20
knob 1 d6.volume 66
knob 1 d7.model 23
knob 1 d7.k4 100
knob 1 d7.volume 64
knob 1 level 94
# T2 a knit finger bass: round, ducked by the kick
preset 2 finger_bass knit
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain 2
knob 2 cut 66
knob 2 ltype pump
knob 2 lspeed track_1
knob 2 lamt 46
knob 2 level 106
# T3 sample piano, the chords: dyads under the tune in the riff, the left hand in the break
preset 3 piano sample
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 brain 2
knob 3 level 90
knob 3 pan 54
knob 3 send1 12
knob 3 send2 24
# T4 sample piano, the tune: bright, a little wider, in the echo and the room
preset 4 piano sample
param 4 oct 2
knob 4 brain 2
knob 4 level 96
knob 4 pan 74
knob 4 send1 22
knob 4 send2 26
# T5 voile soprano as a chop: short sung syllables, the vowel moved by locks
preset 5 soprano voile
param 5 oct 2
knob 5 brain 2
knob 5 a 0
knob 5 d 70
knob 5 s 32
knob 5 r 34
knob 5 e3 108
knob 5 level 106
knob 5 pan 36
knob 5 send1 44
knob 5 send2 34
# T6 knit ribbon: one held voice under everything, pumped by the kick, its filter opened by locks
preset 6 ribbon knit
param 6 oct 2
knob 6 brain 2
knob 6 ltype pump
knob 6 lspeed track_1
knob 6 lamt 56
knob 6 level 68
knob 6 pan 66
knob 6 send2 48
# T7 rayon glass bell: ear candy in the hall
preset 7 glass_bell rayon
param 7 oct 2
knob 7 brain 2
knob 7 level 72
knob 7 pan 92
knob 7 send1 34
knob 7 send2 56
# T8 a second kit: the shaker on the a, a conga, 909 toms for the fills, a rim
knob 8 engine kit
knob 8 d8.volume 58
knob 8 d8.send2 20
knob 8 d9.volume 56
knob 8 d9.send1 14
knob 8 d6.model 23
knob 8 d6.k4 40
knob 8 d6.volume 64
knob 8 d7.model 23
knob 8 d7.k4 90
knob 8 d7.volume 62
knob 8 d10.model 24
knob 8 d10.volume 56
knob 8 d10.send2 24
knob 8 level 90
# FX I a dotted-eighth echo, FX II a hall
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 108
knob 11 e3 52
knob 11 e4 50
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e2 76
knob 12 e3 54
mst lo 62
mst hi 58
mst comp 58
mst pump 24
mst pumpby kick
mst release 68
mst level 104
groove swing

