# ---- scenes and the song: the mask is T1..T8, COND, THROW; x = muted
# intro A: the riff alone, piano and its tune
scenedef 1 1 1 1 1 2 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 1 xx..xxxx..
# intro B: the kick at bar 5, the chop answers, the pad, the bell pickup
scenedef 2 1 1 1 1 2 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 2 .x.....x..
# groove A: the clap, the open hat and the bass arrive
scenedef 3 2 1 1 1 2 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 3 .......x..
# groove B: the shaker and conga, the bell
scenedef 4 2 1 1 1 2 1 2 1 1 1
scenemute 4 ..........
# pre: Cm7 Dm7 Ebmaj7 F, the stabs climb, the snare rolls, the filter opens, the build
scenedef 5 6 4 2 2 8 2 3 4 1 3
scenemute 5 ..........
# drop 1 A: the riff, the bass bounce, the kit
scenedef 6 3 2 1 1 1 1 2 2 1 1
scenemute 6 ....x.x...
# drop 1 B: the chop calls and answers
scenedef 7 3 2 1 1 1 1 2 2 1 1
scenemute 7 ......x...
# drop 1 C: the bell in the gaps, a bigger fill
scenedef 8 4 3 1 1 1 1 6 2 1 1
scenemute 8 ..........
# drop 1 D: the chop sings the tune, the echo carries out
scenedef 9 4 3 1 1 5 1 6 2 1 2
scenemute 9 ..........
# switch A: the piano drops out, the bass plays the riff's rhythm, the chop its tune
scenedef 10 5 5 1 1 5 1 2 3 1 1
scenemute 10 ..xx......
# switch B: the same, busier, the echo carries into the break
scenedef 11 5 5 1 1 5 1 6 3 1 2
scenemute 11 ..xx......
# break A: the piano alone, Cm9 | F13 | Bbmaj9 | Ebmaj9, a soft ooh and the pad
scenedef 12 1 1 3 3 3 3 4 1 1 1
scenemute 12 xx.....x..
# break B: Am7b5 | D7 | Gm, the tune stretches home
scenedef 13 1 1 4 4 4 4 5 1 1 4
scenemute 13 xx.....x..
# build A: the riff returns on the kick and hats, the pad rises
scenedef 14 5 1 1 1 2 2 1 4 1 1
scenemute 14 .x........
# build B: the snare roll, the stabs climb, the bass walks up, the build
scenedef 15 7 4 2 2 8 2 3 4 1 3
scenemute 15 ..........
# outro A: the kick thins, the riff, the chop's last words
scenedef 22 8 1 1 1 7 1 2 1 1 1
scenemute 22 .......x..
# outro B: the bass leaves
scenedef 23 8 1 1 1 2 1 7 1 1 2
scenemute 23 .x.....x..
# coda A: the piano and the chop alone
scenedef 24 1 1 1 1 7 1 7 1 1 1
scenemute 24 xx.....x..
# coda B: the same, sparser, the bell
scenedef 25 1 1 1 1 2 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 25 xx.....x..
# end: the riff alone, Bbmaj9 left ringing
scenedef 26 1 1 5 5 2 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 26 xx..x.xx..
knob 9 e3 9
# drop 2 A, up to C: the bass takes a variation
scenedef 16 3 6 1 1 6 1 2 2 2 1
scenemute 16 ......x...
# drop 2 B: the bell in the gaps
scenedef 17 3 6 1 1 6 1 6 5 2 1
scenemute 17 ..........
# drop 2 C: the chop sings the tune, the fill
scenedef 18 4 7 1 1 5 1 6 5 2 1
scenemute 18 ..........
# drop 2 D
scenedef 19 4 7 1 1 6 1 6 2 2 1
scenemute 19 ..........
# drop 2 E: the bass plays the riff's rhythm under the piano
scenedef 20 4 5 1 1 5 1 6 5 2 1
scenemute 20 ..........
# drop 2 F: everything, the echo carries out
scenedef 21 4 7 1 1 5 1 6 5 2 2
scenemute 21 ..........
knob 9 e3 0
song 1:4 2:4 3:4 4:4 5:4 6:4 7:4 8:4 9:4 10:4 11:4 12:4 13:4 14:4 15:4 16:4 17:4 18:4 19:4 20:4 21:4 22:4 23:4 24:4 25:4 26:4
songloop 0
expect lanes <65

# ---- play the song (HOME, SELECT to the Song page, PLAY)
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
stats reset
wav soundplant_demo_house_909.wav
tap PLAY
bars 104
wait 3000
wavstop
stats
